    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On 13 November 2020, AKU-ISMC students enjoyed a socially distanced completion ceremony at the Aga Khan Centre. The ceremony started with speeches delivered by Professor Leif Stenberg, AKU-ISMC Dean, and Professor Stephen Lyon, Head of Educational Programmes. AKU-ISMC valedictorians, Alina Sabah and Razia Shaheen have also seized the opportunity to share with the audience their study experiences and visions, as well as their aspirations for the future.",
